WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
LYNX SHARE opens FL Studio projects: File, Open, then your .flp.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.600
The patterns, the Playlist, the channels and the Mixer come over.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.400
FL Studio's own plugins, such as 3x Osc, open as LYNX's native versions.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.600
Press Play to hear the song.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Anything that could not come over is listed in Help, Last project import report. Here, nothing.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:36.400
Save it as a LYNX project, or export it back to FL Studio from File, Export.
